{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/87008-ic-werewolf-the-forsaken-the-price-of-redemption","id":87008,"title":"IC [Werewolf: the Forsaken] The Price of Redemption","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-08T14:28:39-08:00","id":87008,"title":"IC [Werewolf: the Forsaken] The Price of Redemption","content":"21 March 2014, approximately 10:30 P.M.<br /> <br /> The Vernal Equinox brings a time that all the Forsaken packs look forward to on the Olympic Peninsula, the seasonal moot. This equinox is the one most packs look forward to most. It is a time of celebration and unbridled revelry. All Alphas lead their packs to the location in Sequim, Washington. A small town just north of the Olympic National Forest located on the Strait of Juan de Fuca looking at Victoria Island, British Columbia.<br /> <br /> The moderate temperatures of the day have cooled slightly under a waning Gibbous Moon, as you walk with your pack to the meeting spot. You round Washington Street and head north on down a minor road off the main road, another turn and you see the location: It looks like a run-down warehouse that has been recently gutted. The walls still contain the shell of the building. Outside it is a still calm night in an older community. The chain link fence offers little in the way of deterrence for trespassing. The fence has been moved at the sign that reads, \u201cBertrand Construction, future home of the Maxmart\u201d and has the imagery of several cogs in the lower left had corner.<br /> <br /> Slipping past the gate, a young but formidable wolf sits as lookout, he stands to an astounding 6\u201908\u201d and opens the door for you. The predator is blatantly obvious.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=lost+girl+bruce&amp;client=firefox-a&amp;hs=ajl&amp;rls=org.mozilla:en-US:official&amp;tbm=isch&amp;tbo=u&amp;source=univ&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=hpQbU9ygGY_zoATOvYEw&amp;ved=0CDEQsAQ&amp;biw=959&amp;bih=680#facrc=_&amp;imgdii=_&amp;imgrc=iPaZVn5g9DOa8M%253A%3BbtQI_8faUL3wTM%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252Fdefault%252Fdownload%252Faph_news.photo.89b4e138147c38a0.4172636865722c20526f622e6a7067.jpg%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252F%3B335%3B500\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=lost+girl+bruce&amp;client=firefox-a&amp;hs=ajl&amp;rls=org.mozilla:en-US:official&amp;tbm=isch&amp;tbo=u&amp;source=univ&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=hpQbU9ygGY_zoATOvYEw&amp;ved=0CDEQsAQ&amp;biw=959&amp;bih=680#facrc=_&amp;imgdii=_&amp;imgrc=iPaZVn5g9DOa8M%253A%3BbtQI_8faUL3wTM%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252Fdefault%252Fdownload%252Faph_news.photo.89b4e138147c38a0.4172636865722c20526f622e6a7067.jpg%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252F%3B335%3B500\" target=\"_blank\"> Google Search </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=lost+girl+bruce&amp;client=firefox-a&amp;hs=ajl&amp;rls=org.mozilla:en-US:official&amp;tbm=isch&amp;tbo=u&amp;source=univ&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=hpQbU9ygGY_zoATOvYEw&amp;ved=0CDEQsAQ&amp;biw=959&amp;bih=680#facrc=_&amp;imgdii=_&amp;imgrc=iPaZVn5g9DOa8M%253A%3BbtQI_8faUL3wTM%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252Fdefault%252Fdownload%252Faph_news.photo.89b4e138147c38a0.4172636865722c20526f622e6a7067.jpg%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252F%3B335%3B500\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.google.com/search?q=lost+girl+bruce&amp;client=firefox-a&amp;hs=ajl&amp;rls=org.mozilla:en-US:official&amp;tbm=isch&amp;tbo=u&amp;source=univ&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=hpQbU9ygGY_zoATOvYEw&amp;ved=0CDEQsAQ&amp;biw=959&amp;bih=680#facrc=_&amp;imgdii=_&amp;imgrc=iPaZVn5g9DOa8M%253A%3BbtQI_8faUL3wTM%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252Fdefault%252Fdownload%252Faph_news.photo.89b4e138147c38a0.4172636865722c20526f622e6a7067.jpg%3Bhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.thegeorgeagency.ca%252F%3B335%3B500 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As you go to enter a more studious looking wolf exits and goes to the big guy, \u201cMy turn.\u201d The big guy moves into the club as the young wolf perches himself on some pallets of bricks and plugs his headphones in.<br /> <br /> The atmosphere of the club is completely different. Inside you feel the heat of all the bodies moving in unison. Sweat is soaking through clothes and pheromones are flooding the air. There are easily 50 Urathra in here comprising everyone from the DJ to the bartender and easily three times the amount of Wolf-Blooded have already arrived. The sexual energy is barely contained and creating a temporary locus, though a lot of packs are more or less sticking within eyesight however, even more eyes seem to be on the Lone Wolf, a man who claims no pack and has been going at it on his own.<br /> <br /> Music: Beast Within by In This Moment<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZATorpf7IA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZATorpf7IA\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZATorpf7IA\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZATorpf7IA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The locus garners more power as the night continues and a few totems even start to manifest. The night is young and so are you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T17:52:06-08:00","id":87108,"title":"","content":"Mesmerized by the raising spiritual energies, Alex slowly makes his way to the bar, watching the dance floor, one eye peering across the gauntlet, clearly a deep indigo spotted with stars. This is Alex' first moot as one of the People. His brother sticking close by his side. Alex didn't dress up as much as he normally would, just in case he decides to shift for anything. No point in ruining the good clothes when decent enough shorts and a tank top would work. <br /> <br /> He really felt his height this time. DAMN! Uratha are usually tall! Being 4'5&quot; tall, even his brother was a foot taller than him! Dad said they could drink, the boys were hoping the bar tender would agree. Getting to the bar, he motions for two drinks, not really caring what they got, just that they got it! Shortly after, Alex hoped he actually had motioned towards someone actually on the right side of the gauntlet to bar tend. His brother Lan guiding him so he doesn't run into things. <br /> <br /> Alex starts scanning the crowd for any guys his age. Every couple heart beats he has to remind himself which side is which. He reaches down and makes a petting motion where Wolf-The-Bones-Whisper-To sits beside him, no longer certain which side his totem is on. It doesn't matter though, he's just happy to have his twin and his totem there by him. His little sister already rushed into the fray of dancing limbs. Neither of the boys knew where their parents had gotten to, but knew that their parents could still see them. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T05:37:03-07:00","id":87439,"title":"","content":"Stephanie arrives with her latest pack. Her alpha, a tall gentleman pushing 30, is saying something as they all walk in, and while Stephanie isn't blatantly blowing him off, she is certainly not paying attention. A smaller Asian woman between the two of them puts out a hand on Stephanie's arm as he finishes talking and the two women look at each other before the hand drops off. Stephanie turns, and walks towards the bar, having spotted a Wolf-blooded she knows from her area. <i>A good segue away from Clark</i>...<br /> <i>Priorities.</i> She wants to talk to the Lone Wolf, try and figure him out. There's a strength in him that appeals to her. But then again, there's this wonderful... passable, construction worker right in front of her. After a bit of small talk she lures him out onto the dance floor.<br /> <i>Better hunting, and a bit more space between Clark and me</i>. She hopes not to ruin the form-accentuating business suit tonight, but recognizes that the stilettos probably won't survive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T12:02:13-07:00","id":87636,"title":"","content":"Grant walks inside, not really knowing what to expect. <br /> <br /> &quot;I mean, bars I get. No problem. But the first rave I ever go to, and it's filled to the brim with werewolves? Shit man, as long as I don't get fuckin' paint in my fur or nothin'.&quot; said Grant, biting back at Great Stone's riff on Grant's nervousness. <br /> <br /> Immediately spotting the bar, he sees someone, a little on the shorter side, trying to chug down a shiner while his totem spirit sits close by. Grant's never seen a totem before, Dougan never getting around to how they even work, so his curiosity is piqued. <br /> <br /> Grant goes up to the bar, orders a budweiser, and looks to the guy petting his totem spirit. &quot;Pretty chill with your spirit there. Bone Shadow too, I'm guessing?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T14:24:27-07:00","id":87727,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile, &quot;This is ridiculous...&quot; Lynn mumbles to herself, sipping her drink at the far end of the bar. Sheepishly, she avoids social interaction, even trying to avoid eye contact. She glances over at a tall, slender figure dancing blissfully in the crowd. &quot;Maya...&quot; She sighs... This was her fault! Some friend indeed. She knew how much Lynn detested social gatherings. This whole trip was Maya's attempt to help Lynn &quot;Come out of her shell&quot;. She sighs again, resting her forehead gently on the bar. &quot;Please just let this night end&quot; as she continues to sulk uncomfortably in the corner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T14:30:37-07:00","id":87732,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, um, ya.&quot; Alex takes a moment to look at Grant, switching focus from one eye to the other to determine which side the guy is on. &quot;Hi, I'm Alex, this is my brother Lan, and this beautiful guide here is Wolf-The-Bones-Whisper-To.&quot;<br /> <br /> Alex extends his hand for a shake, not timidly, but a little unsure if that's appropriate. Alex appears to be around 18 or so, as does his brother. His hair is short, brown, and spiked up. His right eye is deep brown, his left, clearly under the use of a gift. His features smooth, and he doesn't look to weigh more than 95 lbs.<br /> <br /> &quot;A bit warm in here, isn't it?&quot; Alex appears to be a little bit more nervous. He hadn't had enough to drink to start talking to new People.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/16/154ec2eeb26d4f0189573f6fc29f74d6/l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/16/154ec2eeb26d4f0189573f6fc29f74d6/l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/16/154ec2eeb26d4f0189573f6fc29f74d6/l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/16/154ec2eeb26d4f0189573f6fc29f74d6/l.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":".  Added a picture to use for Alex. 03-09-2014, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T06:32:55-07:00","id":88116,"title":"","content":"After a few minutes of dancing, and then some terrible kissing, Stephanie manages to pull herself away. &quot;I'm going to get a drink.&quot; She whisper/yells into the construction worker's ear and snakes her way through the mash of bodies. She can feel his eyes following her, but she pays it no mind and sits in the first unoccupied stool at the bar, next to a girl with her head down.<br /> <i>Either too much or not enough</i>. Stephanie sidles into the seat, making noise as she pulls it out to snap the person up, waves at the bartender as she turns to the girl.<br /> &quot;Hi. You don't know me. Pretend I just said something funny, laugh, casually. Good, helpful. We're suddenly the best of friends. No, scratch that. Make it friends who haven't seen each other forever, because if Face-Sucker looks over here I need coverage.&quot;<br /> Stephanie's navy blue dress is trying to pull the ice out of her blue eyes but it doesn't work, her blonde-and-brown hair is in a loose bun behind her head. She's pretty, but not striking. Her tone is one that says she usually gets what she wants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T14:37:42-07:00","id":88425,"title":"","content":"Grant takes Alex's hand and casually shakes it. He takes a swig of beer, and leans against the bar, still looking at Wolf-The-Bones-Whisper-To.<br /> <br /> Grant's just over 30 and looks like it too. His hands are calloused and his arms have what look like small burn spots dotted around. He's not big, but he's fit and broad shouldered.<br /> <br /> He also isn't socially blind enough to not see he's making Alex nervous. &quot;Uh, you good there man? I haven't been doing the whole 'Be a werewolf ' thing for very long. Am I being too casual? Is talking about another wolf's totem a taboo or something?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":119,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","user":"Strapping Gent","date":". 03-16-2014, 10:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T15:03:01-07:00","id":88443,"title":"","content":"Alex blushes a little bit at being nervous. &quot;Heh, I'm good. I'm fairly new at this too. I didn't think I'd be this nervous, then again, I didn't realize there'd be this many here.&quot; He finishes his drink and sets down the empty glass. He glances at his brother, who is intently watching the dance floor and bouncing to the music. <i>Well, you're no help.</i> Sheepishly smiling he tries to hold eye contact with the man. <br /> <br /> &quot;Talking about totems varies from pack to pack. Double WT here is part of our family though. Been with our family for generations now.&quot; Looking around the club again, he spots his sister dancing with a group of girls, and his uncle watching him. His uncle nods, and questions if Alex is ok with his eyes. Alex nods he's fine, and his uncle continues to watch. <br /> <br /> Returning his attention to the 30-something young pup, &quot;Wait, were you a late bloomer? How long has it been since your first shift? I mean, um, you don't have to answer that. We just keep hoping my brother will shift too. My uncle didn't shift until he was 20. I was 16, almost 17. That's our family's average... I'm rambling.&quot; Alex picks up his refilled drink, and gulps it down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T15:29:32-07:00","id":88462,"title":"","content":"Brushing off Alex's nervousness (uhhhh.. is this guy even old enough to drink?) Grant says &quot;HAH! Yeah I guess you could put it that way. I shifted for the first time about a year ago.&quot;<br /> <br /> Grant checks to see what his pack is up to. Great Stone is on the other end of the bar, kicking back on Taaka. (fuck I don't get how he can drink that shit like water) He's only able to see Kiss for a second before she's lost in the sea of bodies on the dance floor. Dougan is sitting in a corner, talking to a bunch of wolves. It hits Grant that he's swapping stories with Uratha he's known for years, like talking about his last Wild Hunt is just as normal as a Disney World vacation. <br /> <br /> Returning his attention to his conversation partner Grant says &quot;So you're from, like, a lineage or something? Like all the people in your family shift?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T20:26:08-07:00","id":88600,"title":"","content":"Lynn is startled at first, but catches on pretty quick and begins to chuckle. &quot;Someone been... bothering you?&quot; And with a smirk continues: &quot;I mean if you need someone killed... I can help you out.&quot; Finishing the sentence with a strange amount of sincerety. Making it rather difficult to tell if she was joking at all.. Lynn awaits the strange girl's response while scanning the crowd for this &quot;Face-Sucker&quot; individual. Undoubtedly scaring her present company ever so slightly for how ardently she is searching for her &quot;target&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T22:05:58-07:00","id":88662,"title":"","content":"21 March 2014, 2240 hours<br /> Future Location of the Max-Mart Warehouse, Bertrand Construction site.<br /> Waning Gibbous Moon.<br /> <br /> Alex the first one into the bar makes his way to the bar watching the spiritual energies ebb and flow. Though it seems most spirits have decided to steer clear of the current festivities. There are a couple of guys Alex\u2019s age on the dance floor though they seem to be group quite rapidly one does meet his gaze and happens to be the bartender, with his boyish good looks and a playful smile he hands Alex a mojito, the mint leaves still circling the glass.<br /> <br /> Alex I need a perception roll, either you can do it or I can. Or we can find an online dice roller and email me the results.<br /> <br /> Stephanie, you head to the bar, though your eyes keep drifting toward the Lone Wolf, who is sitting with a petite blonde woman wearing a peasants skirt and a wife-beater, her pink bra peeking through transparent shirt. <br /> <br /> Grant walks to the bar and unknowingly interrupts an igniting love connection, ordering a rather pedestrian Budweiser. The bartender pops open the bottle, hands him a napkin, and glares at him and says, \u201cNo charge.\u201d<br /> <br /> Lynn, a rather nondescript woman sitting at the end of the bar sits watching an Uratha dance on the floor as the center of the attention.<br /> <br /> Lynn perception is going to be required if you want to spot the face sucker.<br /> <br /> The music stops for but a moment. The DJ a wolf scans the crowd grabbing the microphone blurts out, \u201cAlright, alright, alright. All you old dogs and new pups in the crowd, DJ Dirty Pawz here, we get some big announcements coming up in a little bit. So grab a couple more drinks chase some more tails but the big dogs gonna learn you something lata.\u201d The man spins once, his dreads trailing behind him, then goes back to the computer and pumps out another track.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T23:17:10-07:00","id":88688,"title":"","content":"((I got 1 success on the perception roll. Damn 10 wouldn't explode to another success, lol))<br /> <br /> &quot;Um, ya. We're either kin or shifters. I expected to be kin for life, ya know, being the runt of the litter.&quot;<br /> &quot;Two, a litter does not make...&quot; Lan interjects.<br /> Alex sticks his tongue out at his twin, takes another look to the boys on the dance floor and the cute bartender before looking back at Grant.<br /> &quot;Been that way as far back as our family tree is tracked at least.&quot;<br /> Alex pauses, and listens to the DJ's announcement.<br /> &quot;I'm sorry, I missed your name?&quot;<br /> After his drink, which was surprisingly delicious to him, he finds himself feeling slightly less nervous. In attempt to bolster his bravery, he takes his tank top off and sets it on the bar. The tone in his muscles show he isn't a tween, but he still isn't huge. The Bone Shadow symbol tattooed on his left pec, a representation of the crescent moon on his right pec.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://scontent-b-sea.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/t1/1185578_10202751245557783_1873928620_n.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">https://scontent-b-sea.xx.fbcdn.net/...73928620_n.jpg</a> (new/final image choice for Alex Price, edited to have the tattoos)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":". 03-11-2014, 03:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T06:51:00-07:00","id":88816,"title":"","content":"Stephanie laughs. &quot;I like your style. Sadly Face-Sucker isn't mine, and being a bad kisser isn't a killing crime. Although some days I think it should be. I'm Stephanie &quot;Leash-Holder&quot;, from the Bel-Red pack. No handshake, old friends remember.&quot; Stephanie's body language says exuberance, but her tone of voice and changes in pitch reveal a more, neutral though equally approachable tone. Stephanie catches a look from the smaller Asian woman and ignores it in favor of the DJ's announcement.<br /> She catches the &quot;large&quot; movements at the bar and see's the <i>young</i> wolf take his shirt off. &quot;That. That is... <i>so </i>not okay. I don't even know where to start.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T10:21:10-07:00","id":88902,"title":"","content":"&quot;Grant. But if you ask my alpha it's Stupid-Worthless-Moron. Hey I don't mean to be taking up your time here. You want me to beat it?&quot;<br /> <br /> Grant's stance could not be more relaxed, making small talk at a bar being something he's been doing for years now. He does, however, notice the bartender keeps glancing at Alex. Grant has no idea why, but assumes he interrupted their conversation.<br /> <br /> &quot;Not gonna lie though, cool ink. One of the People do that, or was it just some guy thinking you were <i>waaaay</i> too into wolves?&quot;<br /> <br /> ((this is about as close a picture as google was willing to provide <a href=\"http://www.mccarthybuild.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Construction-Worker.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mccarthybuild.com/wp-cont...ion-Worker.jpg</a> ))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":119,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","user":"Strapping Gent","date":". 03-11-2014, 01:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T11:31:28-07:00","id":88963,"title":"","content":"Lynn is visibly disappointed, and immediately sighs and goes back to her drink. Downing the rest of it in one gulp and ordering another. After a moment she responds &quot;I'm Lynn... just Lynn. So what's your story? And what's this I keep hearing about some Lone Wolf?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T14:15:17-07:00","id":89040,"title":"","content":"&quot;My grandma did it. My pa calls me Ghost-Tracker. My pa makes fun of me for the ink, grandma thought it was a great idea&quot;<br /> Alex glances about again. &quot;Um, I don't want to be rude, but I was hoping to find a dance partner.&quot; He takes another sip of his drink.<br /> &quot;Ah... who am I kidding. You're at least talking to me. I don't have a chance with any of those hotties out there.&quot;<br /> Alex' eyes go big, like he may have just been insulting.<br /> &quot;Not that you're not good looking. That's not what... I mean... you're just old... NOT that old is bad, and you're not that old. I mean. You're just older.&quot;<br /> He looks between Grant and his brother Lan, then to the bartender.<br /> &quot;Another, please!&quot; In a slightly buzzed stupor, Alex' eyes linger on the bartender for a time bordering on inappropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":". 03-11-2014, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T18:18:58-07:00","id":89151,"title":"","content":"&quot;My story is complicated, Just Lynn.&quot; Her tone is flat again, her postures still exuberant. &quot;He's Packless. That's the most I know. Carved out a place for himself... somewhere, and just takes care of it. Doesn't or hasn't broken the Oath, far as I know, and is surprisingly still alive. So he's REALLY good, or its an easy place. I was actually just about to go talk to him. I'm sure the attentions of <i>three</i> girls instead of just one will be more than helpful.&quot;<br /> <i>And it'll piss off Clark, I think. Its a plus either way.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T00:09:12-07:00","id":89308,"title":"","content":"Lynn's eyes light up at the mention of a packless wolf, &quot;I'm pretty knew to this whole Werewolf scene, still getting used to the politics of it all... Is that, rare? To be packless? I mean I'm sure it's not common but... Is it really that big of a deal?&quot; She says nervously. She is suddenly much more engaged in the conversation, staring fervently into Stephanie's eyes. And for the second time is most likely making the poor girl rather uncomfortable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T09:20:46-07:00","id":89524,"title":"","content":"Realization comes to Grant like water comes to a town after the dam is broken. He looks to Lan and says &quot;Is he gonna be okay? He's been drunk before, right?&quot; <br /> <br /> There's a beat.<br /> <br /> &quot;Wow, now I get what people mean by undressing with your eyes.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T13:36:13-07:00","id":89680,"title":"","content":"Stephanie growls a bit by reflex, the body movements finally reveal an honest tension. &quot;Tone it down, Lynn. Staring into someone's eyes isn't romantic, it's dangerous among the People. Its a challenge; a threat that you think you know better than them.&quot;<br /> Stephanie continues to answer Lynn's question while staring her down. &quot;Some people are famous, famous people get away with things. For the rest of us who are NOT famous, no, its not common. Loners tend to get dead. We are not immortal, just thick-skinned and hard-headed. So the general consensus is, Pack Up. Then pray they don't die.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T14:12:41-07:00","id":89709,"title":"","content":"Lynn reels back, slightly embarrassed at her faux pas. After a moment of awkward silence she continues &quot;Sorry... Like I said, I'm pretty new to this scene. Besides the Hunters I really haven't had much experience with other... Well anyway. He doesn't seem too tough.&quot; She resolves with a smirk. Going back to her drink yet again. Disappointed to find it empty, but solves the problem quickly with a wave to the bartender.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T19:40:26-07:00","id":89887,"title":"","content":"Alex watches the bartender walk to the far end of the bar. Lan elbows him in the ribs. &quot;OOF!&quot;<br /> Lan just smiles at Grant.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, um, what? I'm sorry, I missed what you said.&quot; His rubs his ribs slightly where Lan got the shot in, not that it hurt. It's that annoying feeling that lingers when it comes as a surprise. Alex gently kicks Lan in the shin and shoots him a look. For a split second the boys look like they might get into a tussle, and then smile and resume as if nothing happened.<br /> <br /> &quot;Have you lived in the area long?&quot; Alex returns his attention as best he can to Grant, and slowly sips his new drink. <i>K, got the buzz going, now time to nurse it, enjoy the flavor and keep it going.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T21:58:17-07:00","id":89934,"title":"","content":"21 March 2014, 2300 hours<br /> Future Location of the Max-Mart Warehouse, Bertrand Construction site.<br /> Waning Gibbous Moon.<br /> <br /> Alex notices the spirit of a stag, bound in the corner. The words of his father echo in his head, \u201cThe wolf must hunt.\u201d In the material world his conversation goes swimmingly with grant as his brother banters back and forth with him. Is brother has taken to the rather attractive bartender Chris, since he has not expressed an interest in him.<br /> <br /> The girls continue their chat in the darkened corner of the bar a genuine friendship blooming on some very thin ice. They keep glancing back at the Loner as much of an enigma as an idol to the girls. Though he does seem quite busy with the petite woman he is with now.<br /> <br /> Then DJ Dirty Pawz stops the music and howls, the crowd responds in kind, save for the Lone Wolf, whom most people call Myrmidon. He takes center stage and says, \u201cWe\u2019ve reached the 11<sup>th</sup> hour and now if everyone would help me welcome Gaoler to the stage.\u201d He turns and starts clapping, seeing a very old wolf being escorted to the stage by two young pups. If they aren\u2019t twins they very well could be.<br /> <br /> He takes several minutes walking to the stage giving you a little bit of time to quickly take care of the last bit of business you would like too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T22:03:56-07:00","id":89939,"title":"","content":"Stephanie smiles (it might even be genuine) and relaxes as Lynn backs down. She takes the first sip of her Cosmo, checks her phone, checks on the Lone Wolf again. Ignores yet another look from the Asian woman she walked in with.<br /> &quot;I'll let it slide, Just Lynn. But only because you seem, like, so <i>eager</i> to bury someone. I like that.&quot; Stephanie pronounces it 'barry'. &quot;Looks like the show is about to get on the road.&quot; Stephanie sets down the mostly full glass, and signals to Lynn to follow as she makes her way through the crowd to be near Myrmidon after the announcement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":667,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","user":"ABenniton","date":".  Posted at the same time as our fearless ST 03-13-2014, 01:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T22:08:41-07:00","id":89945,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ooh! Maybe the hunt is soon! We get to hunt stag tonight!!&quot; Alex joins in the howls and clapping.<br /> <br /> Alex, taking advantage of the fray, leans down a moment to Wolf-The-Bones-Whisper-To, slipping the wolf an essence, and whispering in First Tongue, &quot;Could you see what you can find out about that hot bartender for me?&quot; And gives the totem a kiss on the head, that is more akin to a mobster kissing the ring of the godfather. Then returns to the festivities of the Moot. A sly smile slips on his lips as Lan gives him a confused look.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":". 03-13-2014, 01:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T23:31:40-07:00","id":89989,"title":"","content":"Lynn follows eagerly, but stumbles over her own feet shortly after leaving the bar. By the time she catches up with Stephanie, she is starting to think she may have had just a bit too much to drink. Regardless, glass in hand she reaches Stephanie; &quot;So, what's going on anyway?&quot; She asks with only a few slurrs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T11:44:06-07:00","id":91004,"title":"","content":"&quot;Been living in state for my whole life, but I traveled a lot for work.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Lone Wolf's announcement cuts off whatever Grant was going to say next.<br /> <br /> Grant thanks the 2 brothers for the conversation, then heads over to stand by Great Stone. They nod at each other and decide to wait and see what is going to happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":119,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","user":"Strapping Gent","date":". 03-14-2014, 02:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T21:11:10-07:00","id":91373,"title":"","content":"21 March 2014, 2303 hours<br /> Future Location of the Max-Mart Warehouse, Bertrand Construction site.<br /> Waning Gibbous Moon.<br /> <br /> DJ Dirty Pawz makes the announcement not the Lone Wolf. A few minutes later Abraham Cooke makes his way to the center and addresses the crowd in a soft tone, luckily you have keen ears as a wolf.<br /> <br /> &quot;Today marks a time of rebirth. We have recently been besieged by the Pure from the Olympics, Port Angeles, and Victoria. Their latest attack left us one pack short. I am now calling for volunteers to form a new pack in the interest of all of us here. You will be all your own with the resources of the Uratha community in whole including a territory your own. If we have no one to volunteer, Alphas I am calling on you to send us one of your pups. Now will the new pack please join me on stage.&quot;<br /> <br /> Abraham waits patiently with his son and daughter, all the other amongst The People watch for who is forming this new pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T22:55:03-07:00","id":91416,"title":"","content":"After the announcement, Lynn is startled by two soft hands pushing against her back. Confused, she turns to see her good friend Maya, who is drunkenly attempting to guide her to the front of the crowd. &quot;Why? What? No- I....&quot; Lynn mumbles in protest, but Maya simply ignores her and continues. Lynn's pitiful attempts at resisting were nullified easily by Maya's surprising strength and Lynn' clear intoxication. By the time Lynn gets fed up enough to spin around and protest, Maya had already taken a step back, smiling widely.Leaving Lynn standing alone in front of the entire crowd.<br /> <br /> Perhaps it was the alcohol, or the crippling embarrassment, or perhaps she really had no idea what was going on at all. But regardless, when Lynn was asked if she would like to volunteer, She simply blinked twice, looked left and right and responded... &quot;Sure?&quot; with an awkward smile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","user":"Archangel","date":". 03-15-2014, 01:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T02:16:31-07:00","id":91493,"title":"","content":"Slightly confused, Alex slowly looks around the room, studying the various totems and spirits present. <br /> <br /> <i> The fuck is this? Is this normal? Ugh, she looks so happy to be volunteering. DAMN! That guy is old! Whoa... is that within the dress code? Is there even a dress code?</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-15T06:46:24-07:00","id":91596,"title":"","content":"Stephanie, having positioned herself in the crowd near him looks at Myrmidon, she tries to gauge what he might be thinking about the whole thing.<br /> Finally she looks back at Clark. Too eager shows a weakness in Clark's pack which would be... unfortunate in the best of times. As much as their rivalry means to her though, she isn't going to just up and leave like that. Clark knows the Rules, that's why she isn't getting anywhere. She takes the chance and looks over at him, as much for approval as if to say: I'm going to do this so I hope you're okay with it, but tough shit if you're not.<br /> Stephanie takes the stage next to Lynn. (Walking up the side steps if need be; there's no way she's ripping the skirt before the hunt.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T19:20:22-07:00","id":92570,"title":"","content":"Grant stands at the bar, thinking. He lets the bottle rest limp in his hand. This sounds too good to be true. But no Uratha ever did anything important by playing cautious.<br /> <br /> He looks at Great Stone, sets his beer down, and says &quot;Tell the old man 'no hard feelings'&quot; before raising his hand and shouting that he's in. <br /> <br /> Walking up to the women who are now his packmates Grant stares at the crowd. His pack, his old pack now, are standing together and watching him. Of the 3, only Kiss-of-Flame is nodding in her head in approval. For some reason, Grant finds his eyes drawn back to Alex. A feeling in his gut being good enough of a reason, he nods his head at Alex as if telling him to come over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T20:00:59-07:00","id":92587,"title":"","content":"As Stephanie walks by Myrmidon who has remained behind the crowd, she feels it, a locus centered on his mate, the petite blonde. But what is it? Is it something she is carrying or is it the woman herself. Then you get the sense that most of the legends centered around the man are true perhaps he is one of the most deadly hunters on this side of the Rockies.<br /> <br /> Abraham and his siblings smile, and nod in approval, &quot;We have three are there anymore that wish to join the pack? Remember cubs there is safety in numbers but you aren't going to carve a name out for yourself by playing it safe.&quot;<br /> <br /> Myrmidon grabs his wife and heads to stage, everyone stands wide mouthed, then he speaks, &quot;No, no, it's nothing like that. I am not joining the pack of new bloods. I am merely here to sweeten the deal. I will give everyone a territory that is relatively safe while taking care of other business and I will perform a rite for them.&quot; Says the man with the shaved head and plain blue jeans and white tee shirt. Tattooes and make shift jewelry adorn the very masculine form covered in muscle and a lattice work of scars.<br /> <br /> Abraham, &quot;Well there you have it, a pack and a territory, any last takers?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T02:12:56-07:00","id":92701,"title":"","content":"Wolf-The-Bones-Whisper-To nudges Alex towards the stage. Alex looks down at the totem, and then to those standing on the stage to become the new pack, almost trance like. He grabs his brothers wrist and walks up next to grant. Lan sits on his haunches just behind to the back of the stage, out of the way.<br /> <br /> Alex tilts his head, his eye swirling with stars, and continues to observe the spirits. He looks at each of the new pack members one by one, his face lacking any expression. He closes his eyes, and a smile sneaks onto his face. &quot;I'm in.&quot;<br /> <br /> His mother starts to step forward to protest, but his father holds his hand up to stop her, their totem moving to sit next to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T19:52:26-07:00","id":93157,"title":"","content":"Abraham, &quot;Excellent we have a pack. We must commence with a hunt to unify the bond.&quot; with that a deer spirit burst through the guantlet near Myrmidon, runs out the door and jumps over the barbed wire construction fence.<br /> <br /> We can use the roller that Strapping Gent linked in the OOC thread, I will get an email when you use it but go ahead and post the die rolls here as well.<br /> <br /> ...Now off to the races.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T22:37:35-07:00","id":93242,"title":"","content":"Alex leaps off the stage with a mighty howl (spending an essence) and transforming into Urshal he hits the floor sprinting towards the deer, clearing the door he swings to the left, positioning himself as the harrier in the new pack. His short dark grey fur slipping through the air almost seamlessly, quickly he barks out informative markers of positioning and surrounding to his new pack to be.<br /> <br /> [1 success on the page roller Dex + Athletics (Sprinting), whether you use it or just roll for it yourself I'm fine with either.]<br /> <br /> <i>EDIT</i><br /> <br /> Alex quickly glances around the area, keeping an eye on the deer, he nips towards it's and begins spotting landmarks and distinctive features, preparing to direct the deer in a way that is beneficial to the pack, absorbing the lay of the land around the construction site.<br /> <br /> [Wits+Survival (Navigation) plus a willpower: 3 successes]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":"navigation) roll. 03-18-2014, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T23:06:00-07:00","id":93255,"title":"","content":"Throughout the majority of the speech, Lynn was struggling to maintain balance.Giggling occasionally for almost no reason at all. At a glance, it would seem she was paying no attention at all, But with the movement of the deer, her eyes snap focused. Soon after seeing the deer run, escaping her sight, and hearing the conclusion of the speech, a dark smile stretches across her face. Her posture adjusts to a taller, more powerful stance. Her eyes glow with a sharp and dangerous clarity. She steps confidently toward the exit, her swift and elegant movements shocking anyone who had previously noticed her obvious intoxication. With far more alacrity and grace than anyone could have expected, She leaps off the stage, transforming in an instant. With a powerful boom, she lands, followed by the sound of the sharp claws of her Urshul form scraping against the floor as she darts through the crowd and out the door, leaving any hesitant packmates in the dust. Charging bluntly past Alex, she leaps with incredible force onto the nearest roof, hoping to get sight of the target.<br /> [Spent Essence, 3 successes on sprinting, also rolled 7 successes on her jump lol]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","user":"Archangel","date":". 03-18-2014, 02:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T12:55:46-07:00","id":93723,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not the carpet, you'll get mess everywhere...&quot; Stephanie sighs. She looks over to Grant, shrugs, and calmly walks down the stairs and out the front doors; once she rounds the corner, Stephanie slinks into the darkness by the door, taking the time to slowly work into her wolf-skin as though putting on a heavy fur coat. Following the howls of her pack mates, Stephanie follows, hidden behind to try and circle around the deer.<br /> <br /> [Shifting roll: 0 successes, spending an Essence. Stealth in Wolf form: 1 success.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T09:30:59-07:00","id":94298,"title":"","content":"Last out the door, Grant doesn't shift to Urhan until he feels moonlight on his skin.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF8C00\">[Grant spends an Essence to shift]</span><br /> <br /> He follows close behind Alex and Lynn, trying his best to keep pace with the spirit, as well as as using Alex's information to his advantage.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF8C00\">[Grant rolls Dexterity + Athletics with 4 successes]</span><br /> <br /> It doesn't take much before Grant is at the head of the charge, barreling down towards the spirit as fast as he can. Seeing that Stephanie had slunk off into shadows Grant barks at Alex to go left, each making sure to cover exits as much as he can, so that the spirit has no choice but to escape right; directly into Stephanie's waiting jaws. Grant makes sure to keep an ear out for Lynn's bark, waiting for any info on the spirit's trail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T10:18:24-07:00","id":94321,"title":"","content":"The stag spirit barrels out the door, harried through the construction site. Leaps the fences and rushes down the street heading north due to the packs actions where it will find no safe refuge at the Beaches on the Strait of Juan de Fuca. No stranger to this game it knows the predators on either side and pushes to try and create distance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T12:23:53-07:00","id":94377,"title":"","content":"Alex bolts left at Grants bark, snarling at the stag as he re-positions. Taking advantage of his sight, and the better angle of the stag, he racks his brain about what he's been taught about spirits by his family, and scrutinizing the prey. He snarls out useful information to the rest of the pack, and continues to direct the stag to the Strait.<br /> <br /> Alex begins to feel a rising thrill throughout his bones, the excitement of his first hunt, with Uratha he's never really met before, and the fact they seem to be working together rather well. Curious to see how this will unfold and what kind of pack this will be he delves full-heartedly into the euphoria of the experience.<br /> <br /> [Wits + Occult + 3 (WP) with 6 successes. If we are doing conditions, can I give someone the Informed condition?]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T17:23:12-07:00","id":94567,"title":"","content":"Lynn leaps from rooftop to rooftop, following the deer from behind and to the right. Maintaining eyesight of the spirit and barking positions whenever it makes a drastic move. As The spirit nears the beach, she darts forward to prevent a sudden right turn. Unaware of Stephanie's presence or perhaps not even caring. She yells to her other two comrades to maintain formation, with Alex guarding the left and Grant following the deer directly, all sides are cut off while the shore approaches.<br /> <br /> [Sprinting roll if necessary to prevent the deer from juking right and me being too slow, 3 successes.]<br /> [Another jump roll to prevent any loss of speed from jumping off the last available rooftop to the ground, 2 successes on that]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","user":"Archangel","date":". 03-19-2014, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T19:30:28-07:00","id":94642,"title":"","content":"Lynn remember you are in a small town there is quite the distance to leap from rooftop to rooftop. Please you need a means of getting there. This town consists of less that 9,000 people and it only gets more sparse the farther away you get from WA-101. I don't mind you taking some liberties with your posts but let's not magically teleport somewhere after all this isn't Mage. So if you want to get to the roof tops it's going to be a str and athletics roll and eat up the rest of your 'turn'. If you want to jump it's going to be the same with a great deal of successes required","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T16:50:07-07:00","id":95268,"title":"","content":"((I'll take the Condition.))<br /> Stephanie slinks through the darkness, quickly but downwind from the White Stag, keeping to the shadows. Several things run through her mind. She's not used to this; not used to being the noose. But she's not going to let that stop her. She has her role, and she's going to work with it or she's going to die trying. Because she'll be damned if she's going to be the last or weakest member of the pack. Her resolve and determination flow through her along the channels of Essence, bulking her muscles and form into the imposing Urshal as she moves into position along the beach, ready to bring down the White Stag.<br /> <br /> [Essence to shift to dire-wolf for better speed.<br /> Dex + Athletics for Foot chase: 0 Successes (If possible I'd like to resolve the Condition for a single success; not what I meant to do, but that's what happens).<br /> Dex + Stealth + WP to maintain stealth and positioning: 1 Success]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T17:14:06-07:00","id":96060,"title":"","content":"Alex quickly scans the area, pinpointing his <i>new</i> pack mates, and begins to direct the spirit further into Stephanie's laying jaws. He lets out a bellowing snarl that quickly rises into a sharp howl, demanding action of the others in the hunt.<br /> <br /> He glances at Grant, and simply commands &quot;right side,&quot; then to Lynn and snips out &quot;on it's heels,&quot; and he sprints into a close left side position of the Stag, attempting to establish a funnel to direct the stag into the final blow.<br /> <br /> Once he's in his position, his eyes dart directly towards Stephanie, growling his anticipation of her devastating strike to come. The hackles on his back rising as his body surges with the excitement of the hunt. A milky white film covers his eyes, as they take on the appearance of cold dead cataracts. He always loved watching death, it's fascinating and can reveal much about the prey. Perhaps he can learn something from this hunt as well, though this is his first time attempting this with a spirit.<br /> <br /> Assuming the others are doing their part in the hunt, he refocuses on the prey for a moment, his lips curling up in a sadistic wolfish grin, his mind racing with the types of fetishes that could be made from Stag. Memories of previous prey's, though not spirits, bones snapping in his powerful jaws, the blood flowing freely, the flesh tearing, the meat rending away from sinew and tendon. Alex fully immerses into his wolf ready for the best part of any hunt, the kill.<br /> <br /> In the back of his mind, behind the flurry of thought and instinct, Alex feels a little like his father.<br /> <br /> [Perception 4 successes; Hunting roll (Dex+Survival) 1 success; Sprinting into position 3 successes]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1033,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","user":"Lathcon","date":". 03-21-2014, 08:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-23T00:17:15-07:00","id":96764,"title":"","content":"The new found pack works as a team and manages to steer the Gaffling away from the greater population and onto a more remote beach. It is heading for collision on a man in the beach. The deer lowers his head and looks to butt the man out of the way, only the man has another idea. The man grabs the deer spirit by the antlers and snaps its neck.<br /> <br /> The well muscled man sniffs the air and then snarls, &quot;Urdaga!&quot; He then reaches into the rear of his waist band and pulls out a knife that looks as if it is completely carved out of bone. The man then grows another couple feet and packs on another 200lbs of muscles.<br /> <br /> Initiative roll 14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T15:03:15-07:00","id":97776,"title":"","content":"Grant stops running when he sees the werewolf start to grow. Nervous touches at his brain for a second, before being drowned out by lower instincts. <br /> <br /> Whoever this guy is, he's soon to be a very dead mother fucker.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF8C00\">Initiative is 10</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T18:00:21-07:00","id":97932,"title":"","content":"Stephanie stops dead, quirking her massive, dire-wolf head at the stranger it takes her brain a second to work out what the dude said. She sits down in the shadows, seemingly in perfect repose.<br /> <br /> [Initiative is 8. ((I'm beginning to think this die roller hates me...))]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T18:11:47-07:00","id":97941,"title":"","content":"Alex slides to a snarling halt. He begins to stalk counterclockwise around the shifted wolf. He quickly makes eye contact with Grant, then Stephanie, and then Lynn, and calmly snarls to tear apart the <i>pure</i> one. <br /> <br /> [initiative: 8]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T18:44:13-07:00","id":98847,"title":"","content":"Lynn reels in anger at her lost kill, and focuses all of her new attention onto the Pure.<br /> [Init was 19 lol]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","user":"Archangel","date":".  bad idea is bad 03-25-2014, 11:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T20:08:54-07:00","id":98894,"title":"","content":"Lynn contains her anger, aggravated as she may be, she understands her own capabilities. She retreats slightly, making use of her training to blend into the scenery, she calmly lowers her head, allowing her allies to move ahead of her in hopes to stay out of sight and find an opening where the Pure is caught off guard.<br /> [7 successes on blending roll, really don't want to get 1 shot lol]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T23:10:28-07:00","id":98972,"title":"","content":"Lynn ceases movement and takes to the shadows. The Ashenga grips his dagger and moves towards grant, taking the feral dagger and attempts to plunge it into Grant's neck, severing his spinal cord but misses his mark, over extending his reach<br /> <br /> [0 Successes, he has a defense of 5]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T06:49:52-07:00","id":100701,"title":"","content":"Stephanie stares at the Pure. She's tired of all of their interferences, of their continued presence. Of their getting in her way. Most people don't get in Stephanie's way. Sure, they do when they first get to meet her and she's nice if a little blunt. But once they've crossed her, out comes the Mace and it's On. Now there's this Pure that has decided that it's okay to mess with her. Well, it probably is for him. But the Pure have this habit of not thinking about the human things, and Stephanie is going to rub a margarita right into that weakness.<br /> First, though, she needs a name.<br /> [Activating Gift: Know Name (+WP): 0 Successes]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-28T13:59:41-07:00","id":100867,"title":"","content":"Alex Begins the one-two-three process of pack tactics, dodging in and biting at the Pure, the point to be more a distraction than an attempt at damage, hoping the others will follow suit, allowing for Lynn to do a powerful strike from the shadows. Going in on the left, he leaves the right and back open for the others.<br /> <br /> [Bite attack: Base damage 2L; Not sure what Grants action is; If Grant attacks, I have 1 regular dice, if he doesn't I have a chance die]<br /> [Chance Die: Dramatic Failure]<br /> Regular Die: 1 Success for 3L damage]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1033-lathcon","name":"Lathcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1033_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T22:51:53-07:00","id":101771,"title":"","content":"Lynn sinks to the shadows, Stephanie stares blankly at the Pure, Alex attacks sinking his teeth into the pure, Grant is frozen in the streets.<br /> <br /> The Pure looking down at the runt of a wolf growls a warning at the pup the feeling of fear creeps deep inside the pup chilling him to the bone.<br /> [Warning Growl vs. Alex; 2 successes][Defense 5; 7 vs. Lathcon]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T10:04:53-07:00","id":102006,"title":"","content":"Grant gets over his hesitation, trying his best to over come the part of him that's still trying to think like a human. He lurches forward, howling and barking and biting. <br /> <br /> [Bite with 0 successes]<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T20:47:49-07:00","id":102355,"title":"","content":"Lynn waits for an opening, Soon after the pure attacks her comrade, she leaps. Claws at the ready.<br /> [Spending willpower for a Str+Brawl check, and 6 successes. 9-again from the Urshul form, hopin for some surprise bonuses, but i guess the pure not attacking me is a reward in it of itself :P]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2340-archangel","name":"Archangel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2340_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T12:25:47-07:00","id":102846,"title":"","content":"Stephanie sees the shadows moving as Lynn pulls out of the shadow and sinks her claws into the wolf. She takes a look around to make sure there isn't anyone who's going to be affected, then she surges forward. Spirit stuff moving her limbs upwards and outwards. Stephanie may not be a fighter, but the Gauru form more than compensates. She's done playing around, and goes in for the bite.<br /> [Essence to shift Reflexively, Strength + Brawl + WP (-penalties), 8-again: 1 success for 3L]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T22:13:51-07:00","id":103170,"title":"","content":"Having attacks come from multiple angles and Lynn sinking her teeth deep into the Pures hamstring, it shifts to Gauru, reflexively, in doing so drops the klaive and attempts to bite down on the back of the pups neck, hoping to snap it and even the odds. Alex is cowed by the show of dominance from the Pure.<br /> <br /> [Lynn takes 5L damage]<br /> [The Pure at 10L; almost but not quite, one more round should do him in, or do in one of your packmates]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T19:18:56-07:00","id":104530,"title":"","content":"Alex reflexively shifts up to Dalu, taking advantage of having been four legged and close to the ground, he grabs up the klaive dropped by the Pure one.","signature":"","edited":{"us